The domain sampler as one polyTimeComputable_iterateFind loop on the state
⟨⟨1^n, ⟨1^k, ⟦m⟧⟩⟩, ⟨counter, coins⟩⟩ (k by H.size, the test by H.le, a trial
counter so that rounds past the n-th are rejected), payload `true :: block`;
the output is normalised to the index width as the last |p| bits of
⟦p − p⟧_{|p|} ++ block (H.sub, polyTimeComputable_pairDropPoly).

